Z||000002||Brandon86SE||09-22-2001||02:57 AM||||I'm in Diamond Bay (corner of Anderson and Deerfoot).  You'll see me on Deerfoot (do most of my commuting there), in the Chinook area (where I work), and at the Barlow/Memorial corner (where my college is).  That's where I usually am, but I do get around town too.<P>Brandon<P>oh, and yes, the yellow with stripes on Memorial is Voytek, he often sees me on my way to school in the morning, although I rarely see him.  And he's supposed to have the car that stands out!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  Guess I'm too tired at that time in the morning.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Field_Front_(sig)_1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
