Z||000004||RRobinson||09-22-2001||01:55 PM||||I saw a red 88 GT at the gas station in Cederbrae last month, and there's another red 88 GT w/112kms that's been rotting away on a flat tire in some guy's driveway in Coach Hill for a long time. I've left notes on it, but to no avail. I call fiero abuse on that idiot. If you want to let a car waste away in the sun, don't use an 88 GT.<P>I also see Voytek all the time. Pretty hard to miss the yellow.<P>RR||||reg||1
